# Der komponierende Computer (the composing computer / melody generator)
# Busch Microtronic manual Part 2, p. 54. Needs the tone circuit (multivibrator) on outputs 1-4.
# Start it, then press any digit or letter key: the computer composes random melodies.
# Address 0D: the manual prints the mnemonic DOT 0 next to the code FED (DOT D); the code is what the text describes.

@ 00

F08
FE0
F60
FF0
F05
531
40D
